en Rosa y descubre que Rosa es la hija de Consuelo y Adolfo, temiendo por su bienestar al lado de Erasto. Rosa, ignorante de todo, comienza a interrogar a su madre sobre su pasado." type="episode" contentRating="M/16" duration="3600000" grandparentArt="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vpda-thum-wide.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6a3c783f1c9ab3c10e21a9c7" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6a3c783f1c9ab3c10e21a9c7" grandparentRatingKey="6a3c783f1c9ab3c10e21a9c7" grandparentThumb="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/f0264004-d833-4809-8173-dc12f75e70e0/Novelisima_vert_2000x3000_-_Ali_Clausen.jpg" grandparentTitle="Pecado de Amor" grandparentType="show" index="6" originallyAvailableAt="2026-06-16T00:00:00Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vpda-thum-wide.jpg" title="Episodio 6" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episodio 6" type="coverArt" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vpda-thum-wide.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 6" type="coverPoster" url="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/f0264004-d833-4809-8173-dc12f75e70e0/Novelisima_vert_2000x3000_-_Ali_Clausen.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 6" type="snapshot" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vpda-thum-wide.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" id="6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" ratingKey="genre_6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" slug="en-espanol" tag="En Español" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1783771200" duration="3600000" endsAt="1783774800" id="6a485608fd34b401996f2e02" onAir="1" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video><Video guid="plex://episode/6a45b324f3334785955b509f" key="/library/metadata/6a45b324f3334785955b509f" ratingKey="6a45b324f3334785955b509f" summary="Yubiri está echando bromas con Juan Diego y Wilker los ve. El taxista se acuerda de la catira pero esta trata de sacárselo de encima ya que es un taxista. Yolanda va donde Atanasio a llorar porque Briggite le quitó el escritorio. Mauricio está furioso porque a Briggite le aprobaron una asistenta. En la oficina de Brigitte han ido Finita y Ana a reclamarle lo de la asistente. Y Briggite les dice que lamentablemente ella se va a quedar con ella." type="episode" contentRating="M/16" duration="3600000" grandparentArt="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/cgue-thum-wide.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6a1e25448907dc3c7000c157" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6a1e25448907dc3c7000c157" grandparentRatingKey="6a1e25448907dc3c7000c157" grandparentThumb="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/f0264004-d833-4809-8173-dc12f75e70e0/Novelisima_vert_2000x3000_-_Ali_Clausen.jpg" grandparentTitle="Guerra de Mujeres" grandparentType="show" index="20" originallyAvailableAt="2026-06-16T00:00:00Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/cgue-thum-wide.jpg" title="Episodio 23" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episodio 23" type="coverArt" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/cgue-thum-wide.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 23" type="coverPoster" url="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/f0264004-d833-4809-8173-dc12f75e70e0/Novelisima_vert_2000x3000_-_Ali_Clausen.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 23" type="snapshot" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/cgue-thum-wide.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" id="6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" ratingKey="genre_6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" slug="en-espanol" tag="En Español" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media